# Generated solution/IDE files (the .uproject is the source of truth)
ue/*.sln
ue/*.VC.db
ue/*.opensdf
ue/*.opendb
ue/*.sdf
ue/*.suo
ue/*.vsconfig
# Tracked on purpose: ue/Source, ue/Config, ue/Content, ue/Plugins/*/Source,
# ue/Plugins/*/Content, ue/*.uproject, ue/Plugins/*/*.uplugin

# Default Third-Person template content (~129 MB, mostly the Mannequin) -- kept on
# disk so the stock map still opens locally, but NOT tracked. Author your own HISM
# scene + game mode for clones. Scoped to the exact template folders so a future
# World Partition map's One-File-Per-Actor data (under __External*__/) stays tracked.
ue/Content/Characters/
ue/Content/ThirdPerson/
ue/Content/Variant_Combat/
ue/Content/Variant_Platforming/
ue/Content/Variant_SideScrolling/
ue/Content/__ExternalActors__/ThirdPerson/
ue/Content/__ExternalActors__/Variant_Combat/
ue/Content/__ExternalActors__/Variant_Platforming/
ue/Content/__ExternalActors__/Variant_SideScrolling/
ue/Content/__ExternalObjects__/ThirdPerson/
ue/Content/__ExternalObjects__/Variant_Combat/
ue/Content/__ExternalObjects__/Variant_Platforming/
ue/Content/__ExternalObjects__/Variant_SideScrolling/
# Kept tracked (small + reusable): ue/Content/{Input,LevelPrototyping}
